       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SDELTPO.
       AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).

      ******************************************************
      *                                                    *
      *   S D E L T P O                                    *
      *                                                    *
      *D  THIS SUBROUTINE DELETES A SPECIFIED PURCHASE     *
      *D  ORDER AND ALL OTHER RELETED DOCUMENTS WHICH      *
      *D  INCLUDED - REQUISITIONS, RECEIVING SLIPS, AND    *
      *D  INVOICES FROM THE 'STORES' DATA BASE             *
      *                                                    *
      ******************************************************
      *   N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E   I S   *
      *         C A L L E D    B Y :                       *
      *      1. TAPODELT                                   *
      ******************************************************
      *                                                    *
      *C  09/21/95   CA YODER                              *
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO DELETE ENTRIES IN DPOTRACK      *
      *C    WHEN THE PO IS DELETED.                        *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  03/07/96   CA YODER     REQ # 95-039             *
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO DELETE ENTRIES IN DRELTRAK      *
      *C    WHEN THE PO IS DELETED.                        *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  07/12/96   CA YODER                              *
      *C    RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE        *
      *C    CHANGES.                                       *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  11/22/96  JEFF BUNGO                             *
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO DELETE ENTRIES IN DRCVTRAK      *
      *C    WHEN THE PO IS DELETED.                        *
      *C
      *C  05/27/98  CA YODER
      *C    ADDED CALL TO "SCALCBGT" TO CALCULATE THE CORRECT
      *C    BUDGET AMOUNT FOR THE PO.  DECATUR FOUND THAT THE
      *C    TAX WAS NOT BEING INCLUDED IN THE CALCULATION.
      *C
      *C  01/08/2004   CA YODER
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO INDICATE ON THE 32D TRANSACTION
      *C    THAT THE PO ITEM HAS BEEN MOVED TO HISTORY,
      *C    NOT DELETED.
      *C
      ******************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT DPORECD-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPORCV-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
